uro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DbGzUuUtUC4Q7kNvwF4Iauk&_nc_oc=AdrEEAo8m21bEeQjWuf01TPPhTmx3xLkcGs50o3xczyEpJaR3Lx4RaiYNUk_UcrVNwc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGhULlMHnrHBxhdDh51HNLHtOfhJAXbygRfGuUDuDGEyg&oe=6A85AB23"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C3uJ-RfT0E0Q7kNvwHFDx_1&_nc_oc=Adp5N3_gvetsctAnsrtzHv0YjYShLEYEoGH9JA5hXof97FG6P5-9T8U6bFtOAvkAlos&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFeXlBjMEKxtA2pMG90V9EtkpHKSK2bodvhleC65SEBgg&oe=6A85971D"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CU7IByvGJucQ7kNvwFhnOU1&_nc_oc=AdoUkmM9usqTtJmqQLRhApNNOc_BieP9CEfTcUazRDPCJVr5ZR2gPoh911cR0bO_mgg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQERi32JMR6-wLOxpk8L522XKtHG-OSooJgq1F4NI5UNKg&oe=6A85858A"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1061729109131103", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818874_1061729115797769_7442033601794403369_n.png?_nc_cat=109&c